# The shipped model artifact: 438 MB, never tracked, no LFS configured. Left unignored it is one
# stray `git add .` away from a 438 MB commit -- the SLIP-4 shape Rule 14's bulk guard exists for,
# and this submodule has NO hooks installed, so that guard does not protect it here. (2026-09-29)
release/
small_model_28epoch/
wordnet/*.csv

