# Ruff
.ruff_cache/

# taxembed.bridge ships small packaged panels + example results. Override the global `data/` and
# `*.png` ignores above so these (and only these) can be committed with the package. Large/gitignored
# artifacts stay out via the nested data/panels/taxdump/.gitignore (*.dmp) and are never copied here.
!src/taxembed/bridge/data/
!src/taxembed/bridge/data/**
!src/taxembed/bridge/data/results/figures/*.png
# ...but still keep large/regenerable artifacts out even inside the packaged data dir (a user may
# download the big H5s / checkpoints / taxdump here; none of the shipped files match these):
src/taxembed/bridge/data/**/*.h5
src/taxembed/bridge/data/**/*.pth
src/taxembed/bridge/data/**/*.safetensors
src/taxembed/bridge/data/**/*.dmp
src/taxembed/bridge/data/**/sp_metazoa_annotations.tsv
